---
title: Writing Portfolio
permalink: /writing/
pageScripts:
  - /assets/js/writing-sort.js?v=1
---
{% include "header.html" %}
<section class="hero">
  <span class="badge">Writing Gallery</span>
  <h1>Science Communication</h1>
  <p>
    My professional science communication work has primarily been as a credited
    script writer for high-profile YouTube channels such as SciShow, Crash
    Course, and Veritasium, which have cumulatively attracted over 60 million
    views. I have written on a broad field of topics from the history of
    technology to nanophysics, infectious disease epidemiology, archaeology, and
    AI safety. I have also worked extensively with Arizona State University
    creating freely available undergraduate study materials on math, coding, and
    statistics as part of Study Hall, through which viewers can earn
    <b><u><a href="https://gostudyhall.com/">real US college credit</a></u></b>.
    <br /><br />
    As part of my broader <b><u><a href="/non-fiction/">non-fiction</a></u></b>
    portfolio, I am currently working on a book proposal, supported by my
    <b
      ><u
        ><a
          href="https://www.londonwriterscentre.org.uk/news/announcing-the-winners-of-the-2025-wellcome-collection-non-fiction-awards/"
          >2025 Wellcome Collection Non Fiction Award</a
        ></u
      ></b
    >. My book is represented by Sally Holloway at
    <b
      ><u
        ><a href="https://felicitybryan.com/fba-author/ricky-nathvani/"
          >Felicity Bryan Associates</a
        ></u
      ></b
    >. I have also given talks at schools, museums (including the Science
    Museum), and science fairs.
    <br /><br />
    I also dabble in <b><u><a href="/fiction/">fiction writing</a></u></b>.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Highlight Reel</h2>
  </div>
  {% if writing.highlightReel.length %}
  <div class="grid">
    {% for item in writing.highlightReel %}
    <div class="gallery-tile">
      <a class="tile-image" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <img class="tile-thumb" src="{{ item.thumbnail }}" alt="Thumbnail for {{ item.title }}" />
        <span>Video</span>
        <strong>{{ item.title }}</strong>
      </a>
      <div class="caption">
        <p>{{ item.channel }}<br />{{ item.viewsLabel }}</p>
        <details>
          <summary>More</summary>
          <p>{{ item.description or "Description coming soon." }}</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="writing-empty">
    Add one-based row numbers to <code>data/highlight_reel_rows.txt</code> to
    populate this section.
  </p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<div class="mark-divider"><span class="rule"></span>{% include "cos-mark.njk" %}<span class="rule"></span></div>

<section>
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Full writing portfolio</h2>
    <div class="sort-controls" role="group" aria-label="Sort full writing portfolio">
      <button class="sort-button is-active" type="button" data-writing-sort="views">Most viewed</button>
      <button class="sort-button" type="button" data-writing-sort="recent">Most recent</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid" data-writing-grid>
    {% for item in writing.portfolio %}
    <div
      class="gallery-tile"
      data-views="{{ item.views }}"
      data-upload-date="{{ item.uploadDate }}"
      data-row-number="{{ item.rowNumber }}"
    >
      <a class="tile-image" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <img class="tile-thumb" src="{{ item.thumbnail }}" alt="Thumbnail for {{ item.title }}" />
        <span>Video</span>
        <strong>{{ item.title }}</strong>
      </a>
      <div class="caption">
        <p>{{ item.channel }}<br />{{ item.viewsLabel }}</p>
        <details>
          <summary>More</summary>
          <p>{{ item.description or "Description coming soon." }}</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "footer.html" %}
